<title>SWITZERLAND: World trade body chief to visit Japan.</title>
<headline>World trade body chief to visit Japan.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Trade Organisation Director-General Renato Ruggiero will visit Japan on March 18-23 for talks with government leaders, WTO sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>Ruggiero, who is planning a visit to China in April, will also attend a meeting on March 22-23 of the Trilateral Commission linking government, business and parliamentary officials from the United States, the European Union and Japan.</p>
<p>The sources said Ruggiero was expected to meet Japan's Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto, International Trade Minister Shinji Sato and Agriculture Minister Takao Fujimoto during his stay.</p>
</text>
